- ADsSetLastError/ADsGetLastError (per thread), ReallocADsStr
- ADsEncodeBinaryData/ADsDecodeBinaryData, PropVariantToAdsType, AdsTypeToPropVariant, AdsFreeAdsValues

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
